// Dynamic asset manifest for `p19_client::assets::collections::LevelAssets` — every
// `#[asset(key = "...", collection(typed, mapped))]` field there needs a matching entry here,
// each a `Files`/`Folder` dynamic asset (not a plain `File`, which resolves to `Single(handle)`
// rather than the `Collection(handles)` shape `collection(mapped)` requires) that resolves into a
// `HashMap<AssetFileStem, Handle<T>>` keyed by each listed file's own filename stem. Minimal for
// now — add paths under the relevant key once this level actually needs specific rigs,
// skyboxes, or audio.
({
    "armature_rigs": Files(paths: []),
    "world_rigs": Files(paths: []),
    "skyboxes": Files(paths: []),
    "audio": Files(paths: []),
})
